**What was done**: Generated 7 MP4 variants (meta/odrm/odkm/marl atoms with size_64 ∈ [12,19]) and ran each against the ASAN+UBSAN binary.

**Why no crash was triggered**:
1. **UBSAN**: Unsigned integer underflow (`14 - 20` wrapping to `0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFA`) is **defined behavior** in C++ — UBSAN only instruments *signed* overflow, so it silently passes.
